      "finding": "The selected lock already declares the FocusScope 1.1.7 patch; its SHA256 is exactly the lock patch_hash. The patch stabilizes container callback refs and defers null cleanup by a guarded microtask. It does not remove the BODY/removed-descendant fallback. Reapplying a generic ref-churn patch is not a supported repair inference.",
      "classification": "source/lock fact; no independent original CI dependency-payload byte claim"
    }
